          <choice_text>과염소산 － 300킬로그램</choice_text>
          <commentary>과염소산은 300 kg이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>인화성고체 － 100킬로그램</choice_text>
          <commentary>인화성고체는 1,000 kg이므로 옳지 않다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
